<template><div class="app-container"><el-alert title="该列表只展示处理状态和必要关联标识，不展示三诺回调原文、签名或密文。" type="info" :closable="false" style="margin-bottom:16px"/><div class="filter-container"><el-select v-model="query.eventType" clearable placeholder="消息类型" style="width:150px"><el-option v-for="type in eventTypes" :key="type.value" :label="type.label" :value="type.value"/></el-select><el-select v-model="query.processStatus" clearable placeholder="处理状态" style="width:150px"><el-option label="已接收" value="RECEIVED"/><el-option label="处理中" value="PROCESSING"/><el-option label="成功" value="SUCCESS"/><el-option label="未匹配用户" value="UNMATCHED"/><el-option label="处理失败" value="FAILED"/></el-select><el-input v-model="query.uniqueId" clearable placeholder="服务商用户标识" style="width:220px" @keyup.enter.native="load"/><el-button type="primary" @click="load">查询</el-button><el-button @click="reset">重置</el-button></div><el-table v-loading="loading" :data="list" border><el-table-column prop="id" label="编号" width="90"/><el-table-column prop="eventType" label="消息类型" min-width="120"/><el-table-column prop="uniqueId" label="服务商用户标识" min-width="220" show-overflow-tooltip/><el-table-column prop="processStatus" label="处理状态" min-width="120"><template slot-scope="{row}">{{statusText(row.processStatus)}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="errorMessage" label="失败原因" min-width="260" show-overflow-tooltip/><el-table-column prop="receivedAt" label="接收时间" min-width="170"/><el-table-column prop="processedAt" label="处理时间" min-width="170"/><el-table-column label="操作" width="100"><template slot-scope="{row}"><el-button v-if="row.processStatus==='FAILED'" type="text" @click="retry(row)">重试</el-button></template></el-table-column></el-table></div></template><script>import{getJkSinocareCallbackList,retryJkSinocareCallback}from'@/api/jkBusiness';export default{data(){return{query:{page:1,limit:20,eventType:'',processStatus:'',uniqueId:''},list:[],loading:false,eventTypes:[{label:'1001 用户授权',value:'1001'},{label:'1002 设备绑定',value:'1002'},{label:'1003 CGM 数据',value:'1003'},{label:'1004 数字报告',value:'1004'},{label:'1005 文件报告',value:'1005'}]}},created(){this.load()},methods:{rows(r){return(r&&r.list)||(r&&r.data&&r.data.list)||(r&&r.data)||r||[]},statusText(v){return{RECEIVED:'已接收',PROCESSING:'处理中',SUCCESS:'成功',UNMATCHED:'未匹配用户',FAILED:'处理失败'}[v]||v||'-'},load(){this.loading=true;getJkSinocareCallbackList(this.query).then(r=>this.list=this.rows(r)).finally(()=>this.loading=false)},reset(){this.query={page:1,limit:20,eventType:'',processStatus:'',uniqueId:''};this.load()},retry(row){this.$confirm('确认重新处理该三诺回调记录？','三诺回调重试').then(()=>retryJkSinocareCallback(row.id)).then(()=>{this.$message.success('已提交重试');this.load()})}}}</script>
